---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import amber from '../../assets/images/stat-amber.png';
---

<section class="why container section split" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="why__text split__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Why fractional, why now</p>
    <h2 id="why-title" class="h2">Fractional leadership, proven in numbers.</h2>
    <p>
      Growing businesses need experienced marketing leadership to compete in a fast-moving market, but can’t
      always justify or afford a full-time CMO. A typical CMO hiring cycle can take six to nine months — time most
      growth-stage businesses don’t have.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="why__stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <p class="stat__value">40%</p>
      <p class="stat__label">Indian startups now use fractional CMOs as part of their growth plan.</p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="stat stat--photo photo-card on-dark"
      style="--tint: linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-dark) 10%, transparent) 15%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-dark) 88%, transparent) 80%)"
    >
      <Image class="photo-card__bg" src={amber} alt="" widths={[331, 662]} sizes="(min-width: 900px) 330px, 50vw" />
      <p class="stat__value">30%</p>
      <p class="stat__label">
        Faster implementation of effective marketing strategies when companies involve a Fractional CMO.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why__stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .stat {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 385px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--color-panel);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .stat--photo {
    background: var(--color-dark);
  }

  .stat__value {
    color: var(--color-heading);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 32;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 3vw + 1.5rem, 4rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .stat__label {
    max-width: 30ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .stat {
      min-height: 280px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .why__stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .stat {
      min-height: 220px;
    }
  }
</style>
